<title>POLAND: BANKS BID FOR PLN 427 MLN FIXED BONDS AT OUTRIGHT.</title>
<headline>BANKS BID FOR PLN 427 MLN FIXED BONDS AT OUTRIGHT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks bid for 225 million zlotys of 17-percent two-year bonds against the central bank's 161 million zloty outright offer and for 202 million zlotys 14-percent five-year bonds against the 178 million zloty offer.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
